    <item>
      <title>Petition to Protect Rural Post Offices</title>
      <link>https://keithpound.com/2025/07/15/petition-to-protect-rural-post.html</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Jul 2025 16:58:00 +0100</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://KeithPound.micro.blog/2025/07/15/petition-to-protect-rural-post.html</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Our post office and the one in the neighbouring village have closed in recent months, which harms our communities, especially the older residents and those without transport.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I received the attached letter from my member of parliament today, who has started a petition calling on the government to support rural post offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It’s not just for folks in Devon, but all UK rural areas. Please sign if you are able.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&#34;caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;&#34; data-en-clipboard=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.carolinevoaden.com/post/sign-my-petition-calling-for-the-government-to-protect-rural-post-offices&#34; rev=&#34;en_rl_none&#34;&gt;https://www.carolinevoaden.com/post/sign-my-petition-calling-for-the-government-to-protect-rural-post-offices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img title=&#34;Voaden letter.png&#34; src=&#34;https://keithpound.com/uploads/2025/voaden-letter.png&#34; alt=&#34;a letter from my member of parliament about her petition to protect rural post offices&#34; width=&#34;433&#34; height=&#34;600&#34; border=&#34;0&#34; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#devon&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
    </item>
    
